{% comment %}
  TIKVES LONDON · HOMEPAGE URGENCY BAND · 2 Nov 2026 · REF · HORMOZI OFFER IN FULL v4
  One band, one message at a time, chosen by the clock in snippets/tl-dates:
  Black Friday (the line from Tue 24 Nov, the offer Fri 27 Nov to Thu 3 Dec),
  else the Christmas Six or the Christmas order-by date, else the gift card
  from 17 to 24 December. After that it renders nothing at all.
  Homepage rulings it follows: the one cream with no darker band and no lines,
  headings in title case, words centred on the phone, tight spacing.
  All the words and logic live in snippets/tl-urgency, mode 'band'.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="page-width">
  {%- render 'tl-urgency', mode: 'band', hide_xmas: section.settings.hide_xmas -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Countdown band",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Black Friday, then the Christmas Mix or the Christmas order-by date, then the gift card, each in its own dates. The words and dates live in the theme code, not here, so they can't drift from the discounts."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "hide_xmas",
      "label": "Leave out the Christmas panel",
      "default": false,
      "info": "On while the Christmas Mix hero sits at the top of the homepage, so the offer isn't said twice. Black Friday and the gift card still show in their dates."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Countdown band"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
